WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.342
Metacognition helps people observe, evaluate, and improve their own thinking.

2
00:00:04.342 --> 00:00:09.119
It includes awareness of understanding, strategy, assumptions, confidence, errors, and feedback.

3
00:00:09.119 --> 00:00:16.500
It is useful because many learning and performance problems are not caused by lack of effort alone.

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:25.619
They happen because people do not notice when their current method, model, or confidence is no longer aligned with the task.

5
00:00:25.619 --> 00:00:30.830
Strong metacognitive practice includes planning, monitoring, reflection, calibration, feedback, and strategy adjustment.

6
00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:34.303
Planning helps choose an approach before work begins.

7
00:00:34.303 --> 00:00:38.645
Monitoring catches confusion and uncertainty while work is in progress.

8
00:00:38.645 --> 00:00:41.251
Reflection turns experience into reusable learning.

9
00:00:41.251 --> 00:00:43.856
Calibration keeps confidence connected to evidence.

10
00:00:43.856 --> 00:00:49.067
Strategy adjustment changes the method when the current method is not working.

11
00:00:49.067 --> 00:00:53.409
The goal is not endless introspection or harsh self-criticism.

12
00:00:53.409 --> 00:01:00.356
The goal is better learning, better judgment, clearer decisions, and more reliable performance under real conditions.

13
00:01:00.356 --> 00:01:12.949
Metacognition gives people practical checkpoints: what do I know, what am I assuming, how confident should I be, what feedback do I have, and what should I change next?

14
00:01:12.949 --> 00:01:15.988
Used well, metacognition makes people more adaptable.

15
00:01:15.988 --> 00:01:27.278
It helps learners avoid passive content consumption, helps professionals catch weak assumptions, helps teams communicate uncertainty, and helps AI users separate polished output from verified understanding.

16
00:01:27.278 --> 00:01:36.831
It is a quiet skill, but it changes the quality of the work because it improves the thinking that produces the work.
